#: ../../c-api/none.rst:6
msgid "The ``None`` Object"
msgstr "Objekt ``None``"

#: ../../c-api/none.rst:10
msgid ""
"Note that the :c:type:`PyTypeObject` for ``None`` is not directly exposed in"
" the Python/C API.  Since ``None`` is a singleton, testing for object "
"identity (using ``==`` in C) is sufficient. There is no "
":c:func:`!PyNone_Check` function for the same reason."
msgstr ""
"Všimněte si, že :c:type:`PyTypeObject` pro ``None`` není v Python/C API "
"přímo vystavený. Protože ``None`` je singleton, testování identity objektu "
"(pomocí ``==`` v C) je dostačující. Z téhož důvodu neexistuje funkce "
":c:func:`!PyNone_Check`."

#: ../../c-api/none.rst:18
msgid ""
"The Python ``None`` object, denoting lack of value.  This object has no "
"methods and is :term:`immortal`."
msgstr ""
"Pythonový objekt ``None``, označující absenci hodnoty. Tento objekt nemá "
"žádné metody a je :term:`immortal`."

#: ../../c-api/none.rst:21
msgid ":c:data:`Py_None` is :term:`immortal`."
msgstr ":c:data:`Py_None` je :term:`immortal`."

#: ../../c-api/none.rst:26
msgid "Return :c:data:`Py_None` from a function."
msgstr "Vrátí :c:data:`Py_None` z funkce."

#: ../../c-api/none.rst:8
msgid "object"
msgstr "objekt"

#: ../../c-api/none.rst:8
msgid "None"
msgstr "None"
